      <title>Trump touts low Christmas season gasoline prices, and analysts say they should hold into 2026</title>
      <link>https://justthenews.com/politics-policy/energy/trump-touts-low-christmas-gasoline-prices-and-analysts-say-they-should-hold?utm_source=justthenews.com&amp;utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_campaign=external-news-aggregators</link>
      <description>December gasoline prices have not been this low since 2020. Analysts say many factors are contributing to the low prices, including a better regulatory environment for oil and gas, industry operation efficiencies, and high supply with expectations of low demand on the global market.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://justthenews.com/politics-policy/energy/trump-touts-low-christmas-gasoline-prices-and-analysts-say-they-should-hold?utm_source=justthenews.com&amp;utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_campaign=external-news-aggregators</guid>
